From b0bdb0170039cc7c2b11c6114de555faa34ae6f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 13:26:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Milestone 4: PO import with the fake extractor

Worker (Go):
- queue: claim with FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED in one UPDATE, attempts counted at
  claim, max 3 tries, stale-job recovery, daily cleanup of fetched/old jobs
- storage: download/delete in po-images with the service key (new sb_secret_
  and legacy JWT keys); a missing page fails the job at once
- runner: validate model output before storing, delete pages when done or
  failed for good, put the job back on shutdown without using a try
- tests against Postgres incl. the phone round trip through submit_extraction
  and mark_extraction_fetched; systemd unit and env example

App:
- Inbox (mockup B): camera (multi-page), gallery (multi-select), statuses
  Antre/Mengunggah/Diproses/Perlu dicek/Tersimpan/Gagal, retry, delete
- upload to po-images/{store}/{po}/{n}.jpg, submit, poll, import + matching,
  mark fetched; offline-safe, resumes on next run
- share from WhatsApp handled in MainActivity.kt (no plugin), images shrunk
  to 1600 px and turned upright
- Inbox in the bottom bar and sidebar with a 'Perlu dicek' badge
